Standard interpreter 1.1

Backstage at the XYZZY Awards
Thick velvet curtains.
Lights hang from catwalks above,
Like dew on a leaf.

Justin Timberlake slouches around, looking infuriatingly self-satisfied.

>x me
Clad in canvas overalls, you look like just another of the hundreds of workers who keep things ticking backstage.
There is thunderous applause and noise from the audience, for no particular reason.

>x Justin
Vileness abounds.
Vultures feast on rotting flesh,
But none would eat him.
You can hear whispering among the spectators in the box seats.

>hit Justin
You throw yourself at him with a harrowing battle cry, but security guards appear out of the shadows, restrain you painfully, then disappear again.
Someone gets up and makes a clever acceptance speech.

>kiss Justin
God forbid.
There is thunderous applause and noise from the audience, for no particular reason.

>ask Justin about Justin
Since he's an undeserving megastar and you're simply a hardworking guy, he doesn't even notice you.
There is thunderous applause and noise from the audience, for no particular reason.

>x curtains
They're just curtains.
I can only write a few
clever haikae.
Suddenly, a spandex-clad figure smashes through a wall high overhead! Masonry falls all around.

>wait
Time passes.

>x chunk
It's just a big slab
Of the technological
Prisons mankind builds.

>take it
Taken.
A muscular, bronze-skinned, and mostly naked man staggers into the wings, bleeding from a number of deep gashes. He wanders vaguely in the direction of the stage before collapsing in a heap.
>throw it at Justin
The large chunk of concrete glances off his expensively restructured chin, but does not, alas, do any damage.
You can hear whispering among the spectators in the box seats.

>x adventurer
His name is Boldo.
He has acquired treasure,
But not kept his life.
There is thunderous applause and noise from the audience, for no particular reason.

>search Boldo
Searching through his pockets, you find the Jeweled Eye of Wossname!

>g
Searching through his pockets, you find a ladder! (he has really big pockets)
There is thunderous applause and noise from the audience, for no particular reason.

>g
Searching through his pockets, you find the death star!

    *** Boldo is no longer happy to see you ***



>x eye
I don't really know
what a Jeweled Eye should look like.
But maybe you do.

>x ladder
Either this is small
or Boldo has large pockets.
Either way is weird.

>x death star
SMALL MOON KICK THE HELL OUT OF YOU
You can hear whispering among the spectators in the box seats.

>drop ladder
Dropped.

>up
You ascend the ladder...

On the Catwalk
You're on the catwalk.
Please don't do a little dance.
You're not that sexy.

>drop chunk
You drop the stone, cracking Justin Timberlake's head nicely open. Amazingly, nobody below thinks to look up, so scurrying off to join your colleagues, nobody's the wiser.


    *** MTV cries! ***


